<title>FRANCE: Tunisia buys 100,000 T feed barley - traders.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys 100,000 T feed barley - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia on Thursday bought 100,000 tonnes of optional-origin feed barley at $136.64 per tonne, including cost and freight, European grain traders said.  </p>
<p>Tunisia bought four cargoes of 25,000 tonnes each, they said.</p>
<p>The barley is for shipment from May 10 until August 20.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
